  <p id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan:p001:m0000" ref="5ql_hfz_086">叔安</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan:p001:m0003" ref="5ql_hfz_086">子仁</persName>，淸河人。髙帝即位，懷其忠正，時爲益州司馬、甯蜀太守，就拜前將軍。方用爲梁州，會病卒。帝歎曰：「<persName id="c-nanshi-016-fangshuan:p001:m0053" ref="5ql_hfz_086">叔安</persName>節義，古人中求之耳，恨不至方伯而終。」</p>
</text>
